            <ArticleTitle>Draft Genome Sequence of Prevotella copri Isolated from the Gut of a Healthy Indian Adult.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">e00834-17</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1128/genomeA.00834-17</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Prevotella copri, a Gram-negative anaerobic rod-shaped bacterium, is frequently associated with the human gastrointestinal tract and influences host physiology, immunity, and metabolic pathways. In the present study, we report the draft genome sequence of P. copri isolated from the gut of a healthy Indian adult.</AbstractText>
